{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"冯·诺依曼·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"john-von-neumann","categoryLabel":"冯·诺依曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/18_john-von-neumann/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>本卷回答一个问题：冯·诺依曼究竟&quot;做出了什么&quot;——那些以他命名、改变了多个学科走向的具体成果。三章分别对应他影响最深的三条主线：<strong>奠定现代计算机的体系结构</strong>、<strong>创立博弈论</strong>、以及在<strong>纯数学与跨界科学</strong>中的旷世广度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-在全集中的分工\">本 hub 在全集中的分工</h2><p>冯·诺依曼全集共六卷，各有专责。本卷（核心贡献）讲&quot;<strong>做出了什么成果</strong>&quot;，与兄弟卷刻意错开、互不重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供成果的传记背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心贡献（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>他做出了什么具体成果</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>这些成果背后的思维方式</td>\n<td>把本卷成果抽象为方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作品</a></td>\n<td>承载成果的著作文本</td>\n<td>提供 EDVAC 报告、《博弈论与经济行为》等原典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>成果如何塑造后世</td>\n<td>接续本卷讲下游影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>署名争议、核武立场等</td>\n<td>提供对本卷成果的批判性审视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：想知道&quot;EDVAC 报告写了什么&quot;去<a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作品</a>，想知道&quot;存储程序作为一种思想&quot;去<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>，想知道&quot;署名是否公允&quot;去<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>；本卷只讲成果本身是什么、为何重要、有何代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章内容与去重边界\">三章内容与去重边界</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;核心贡献&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1 冯·诺依曼架构&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;2 创立博弈论&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;3 旷世全才&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;1.1 存储程序(抽象原则)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;1.2 体系结构(具体机器)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;2.1 数学奠基与最小最大定理&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;2.2 引入经济学与现实影响&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;3.1 纯数学根基&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;3.2 量子力学与跨界应用&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"核心贡献\"] --&gt; B[\"1 冯·诺依曼架构\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"2 创立博弈论\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"3 旷世全才\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"1.1 存储程序(抽象原则)\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"1.2 体系结构(具体机器)\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"2.1 数学奠基与最小最大定理\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"2.2 引入经济学与现实影响\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"3.1 纯数学根基\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"3.2 量子力学与跨界应用\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章·冯·诺依曼架构</strong>：<a href=\"the-von-neumann-architecture/the-stored-program-concept\">存储程序</a>讲抽象原则（指令即数据），<a href=\"the-von-neumann-architecture/architecture-of-computers\">体系结构</a>讲具体机器（五部件、单总线与瓶颈）。前者是&quot;为何&quot;，后者是&quot;如何&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·创立博弈论</strong>：<a href=\"founding-game-theory/the-theory-of-games\">博弈论的创立</a>讲数学奠基（最小最大定理），<a href=\"founding-game-theory/game-theory-and-economics\">博弈论与经济学</a>讲落地经济学与诺贝尔奖谱系。前者数学，后者应用。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·旷世全才</strong>：<a href=\"a-universal-genius/contributions-to-mathematics\">对数学的贡献</a>讲纯数学（序数、算子代数、遍历理论），<a href=\"a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond\">量子力学及其他</a>讲跨界（量子力学、元胞自动机、曼哈顿计划）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：本卷的数学篇涉及希尔伯特空间、混合策略概率、期望值等概念，具备大学一年级线性代数与概率基础读起来最顺；无此基础者可跳过 KaTeX 公式，正文均配有直觉解释。</li>\n<li><strong>计算机方向读者</strong>：第一章 → <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/shaping-the-computer-age/\">影响与遗产·塑造计算机时代</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>经济/社科方向读者</strong>：第二章 → <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/influence-across-fields/\">影响与遗产·跨领域影响</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>想看思想方法的读者</strong>：读完任一章后转入<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>，那里把成果提炼为可迁移的思维。</li>\n<li><strong>完整阅读</strong>：建议先读<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>建立背景，再按 1→2→3 顺序通读本卷，最后以<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>收尾，形成立体认识。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-von-neumann-architecture","title":"冯诺依曼架构","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/the-von-neumann-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-stored-program-concept","title":"存储程序的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/the-von-neumann-architecture/the-stored-program-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture-of-computers","title":"计算机的体系结构","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/the-von-neumann-architecture/architecture-of-computers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-game-theory","title":"创立博弈论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-theory-of-games","title":"博弈论的创立","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory/the-theory-of-games"},{"seq":2,"slug":"game-theory-and-economics","title":"博弈论与经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/founding-game-theory/game-theory-and-economics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"a-universal-genius","title":"全才","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contributions-to-mathematics","title":"对数学的贡献","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/contributions-to-mathematics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-mechanics-and-beyond","title":"量子力学及其他","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/core-contributions/a-universal-genius/quantum-mechanics-and-beyond"}]}]}